{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-50000pc-water-beads-sold-via-amazon-2508-0084","content_id":"3a5649a9-5397-474c-910b-1db7f400b04b","description":"Product Safety Report for 50,000pc Water Beads sold via Amazon presenting a risk of asphyxiation. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"cc80a5e1-b440-48b0-8987-7cf05822dd58","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-06-17T14:13:05+01:00","id":"cc80a5e1-b440-48b0-8987-7cf05822dd58","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-06-17T14:13:05+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a329d61c6e94f095f3ef966/2508-0084-product-safety-report-50000pc-water-beads.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: 50,000pc Water Beads sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a high risk of asphyxiation because if the product is swallowed in its hydrated form, it can block a young child’s airway.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product is no longer available for sale.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Decorative articles/Homeware/Gardenware – Flower/Plant Pots Replacement Parts/Accessories</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon ASIN</td>\n      <td>B08X7G68SF </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon Listing Name</td>\n      <td>TBST Water Beads, 50,000 Pcs Colorful Water Crystal Beads, Gel Soil Water, Stress Relief Crystal Bea</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Unknown</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Multi-coloured 50,000pc of water beads sold in clear plastic tub.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_cc80a5e1-b440-48b0-8987-7cf05822dd58\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a329d61c6e94f095f3ef966/2508-0084-product-safety-report-50000pc-water-beads.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a high risk of asphyxiation because if the product is swallowed in its hydrated form, it can block a young child’s airway.  </p>\n\n<p>OPSS has published a Product Safety Alert for water beads, which can be accessed at: <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-alert-water-beads-psa7\">https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-alert-water-beads-psa7</a>     </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product is no longer available for sale. We recommend owners stop using this product immediately. Contact the distributor you purchased from to request redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2508-0084</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-22T11:33:33Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"household-decorative-articles","product_measure_type":["other"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-06-17","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-06-22T12:33:33+01:00","links":{"available_